{"pageid":3322,"title":"Corrupt Acacia","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Corrupt Acacia</span>","revid":18793,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Corrupt Acacia</b> is part of the 2024 Halloween update. It can be obtained by exposing <a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">Acacia</a> to a spore made by <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a> (Formally found in the Desert on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>)\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Corrupt Acacia</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corrupt_acacia.png/revision/latest?cb=20241006082800\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Corrupt acacia\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corrupt_acacia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241006082800\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corrupt_acacia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241006082800 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corrupt_acacia.png/revision/latest?cb=20241006082800 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Corrupt acacia\" width=\"270\" height=\"451\" data-image-key=\"Corrupt_acacia.png\" data-image-name=\"Corrupt acacia.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div cla