ersion Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.68.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 4th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\nJust a corrupted version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">Acacia</a> tree. Despite being the corrupted version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">Acacia</a> , it resembles a willow tree but in  purple hue. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>NOTE: They have been confirmed as permanent.      \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".F0.9F.9F.A3.7C_The_Corruption\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"🟣|_The_Corruption\">🟣| The Corruption</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The corruption is spreading all over the Desert... Something doesn't seem right...</li>\n<li>These (PERMANENT) materials have been added: The Corrupted, Corrupted Acacia Tree, Corrupted Cactus, Corrupted Deadwood, Corrupted Tumbleweed, and Corrupted Limestone.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<blockquote><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1291819912012238938\">https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/12918